{"b":"Ps","c":3,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"LORD, how are they increased that trouble me! many are they that rise up against me.","it":[[51,54]],"x":[["Ps.17.7",12,"w"],["2Sam.17.11",6,"r"],["2Sam.17.13",6,"r"],["2Sam.16.15",4,"r"],["2Sam.15.1",3,"r"],["2Sam.15.18",3,"r"],["Matt.27.25",2,"r"],["Matt.10.21",2,"w"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Many there be which say of my soul, There is no help for him in God. Selah.","it":[[5,13],[36,44]],"x":[["Ps.71.11",9,"r"],["Ps.42.3",8,"r"],["Ps.42.10",7,"r"],["Ps.22.7",6,"r"],["Ps.4.4",5,"w"],["Matt.27.42",4,"r"],["Matt.27.43",4,"r"],["Ps.3.8",3,"w"],["2Sam.16.7",3,"r"],["2Sam.16.8",3,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"But thou, O LORD, art a shield for me; my glory, and the lifter up of mine head.","it":[[18,21]],"tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.27.6",72,"w"],["Ps.28.7",64,"w"],["Gen.15.1",52,"w"],["Ps.119.114",51,"w"],["Isa.60.19",43,"w"],["Ps.62.7",36,"w"],["Ps.84.11",35,"e"],["Ps.18.2",32,"r"],["Ps.110.7",24,"w"],["Rev.21.23",24,"w"]]},{"n":4,"t":"I cried unto the LORD with my voice, and he heard me out of his holy hill. Selah.","x":[["Ps.34.4",14,"r"],["Ps.91.15",11,"r"],["Isa.65.24",10,"r"],["Ps.34.6",8,"e"],["Ps.2.6",6,"w"],["Matt.7.7",6,"r"],["Ps.43.3",6,"w"],["Jer.29.12",6,"r"],["Jer.29.13",6,"r"],["Jas.5.13",6,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"I laid me down and slept; I awaked; for the LORD sustained me.","x":[["Ps.4.8",28,"r"],["Prov.3.24",22,"r"],["Isa.26.3",20,"r"],["Lev.26.6",17,"r"],["Job.11.18",14,"r"],["Job.11.19",14,"r"],["Ps.127.2",9,"r"],["Prov.18.10",9,"r"],["Prov.14.26",6,"r"],["Ps.66.9",4,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"I will not be afraid of ten thousands of people, that have set themselves against me round about.","it":[[63,73]],"x":[["Rom.8.31",18,"r"],["Ps.118.10",16,"r"],["Ps.118.12",16,"r"],["Ps.27.1",16,"w"],["Ps.27.3",16,"r"],["Ps.23.4",14,"r"],["2Kgs.6.15",12,"r"],["2Kgs.6.17",12,"w"],["Ps.46.7",9,"r"],["2Sam.18.7",8,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Arise, O LORD; save me, O my God: for thou hast smitten all mine enemies upon th